
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Inkora — Your Story Begins Here</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #fff8f8;
      color: #421d2b;
    }

    header {
      background: #651f39;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    header span {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    nav {
      padding: 14px 20px;
      background: #f8e8ed;
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #651f39;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 28px 20px;
    }

    .hero {
      background: #f1d5df;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .hero p {
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .button {
      background: #651f39;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .stories {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .story {
      background: white;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid #f0dce3;
    }

    .story .cover {
      background: #ead0db;
      min-height: 120px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 34px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .story h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      color: #795563;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>INKORA</h1>
    <span>A world written by you.</span>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#discover">Discover</a>
    <a href="#stories">Stories</a>
    <a href="#community">Community</a>
  </nav>

  <main id="home">
    <section class="hero">
      <h2>Your next favorite story awaits.</h2>
      <p>
        Discover unforgettable stories, create your own characters,
        design beautiful book covers, and connect with readers and writers.
      </p>
      <button class="button" onclick="document.getElementById('stories').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">
        Explore Stories
      </button>
    </section>

    <section id="discover">
      <h2>Discover Stories</h2>
      <p>Every story begins with a single page.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="stories" id="stories">
      <article class="story">
        <div class="cover">♡</div>
        <h3>Beyond the Pages</h3>
        <p>A world of secrets, emotions, and unexpected choices.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="story">
        <div class="cover">✦</div>
        <h3>Silent Promises</h3>
        <p>Some stories are written in words. Others in silence.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="story">
        <div class="cover">❦</div>
        <h3>Midnight Letters</h3>
        <p>One message can change everything.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section id="community">
      <h2>Welcome to the Inkora Community</h2>
      <p>Read. Write. Create. Connect.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Inkora. Every story deserves a home.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
